Fire!

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:53.540
After a series of intense battles,

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:58.480
this Beyblade Super Battle Tournament has reached the climax!

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:00.930
We're about to be witness to the final fight!

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:02.840
Taking part in it will be...

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:06.450
Kai Hiwatari and Takao Kinomiya!

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:09.980
This is going to be one heck of a battle, no doubts about it!

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:20.420
Man, I'm really starting to get fired up!

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:25.200
It seems they prepared a Special Stage for the finals!

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.690
Okay, with this, the examination is over.

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:31.200
Now your Dragoon is perfect.

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:33.280
Thank you, Professor!

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:35.450
Takao! The finals are here at last!

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:37.980
Yeah! I can't wait!

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:45.480
Takao vs Kai, The Fated Duel

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:50.440
The strength of Takao's Shoot
went beyond my projections,

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:54.200
the new Attack Ring proved to
be more than powerful enough.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.880
I managed to gather some interesting data.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:03:01.700
Let's see... To further improve the effects of Takao's Shoot, the next point to modify is...

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.900
You still want to modify Dragoon?

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:10.320
But of course! There's no such thing as 'the end' in my research.

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:15.430
I see you're eyeing a friction-type Grip Base!

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:17.210
Indeed!

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:19.700
In order to raise Dragoon's attack power,

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:20.850
we need to consider his movement speed...

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:23.920
A case with the friction on the base of the grip..?

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:25.620
Takao!

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:27.790
Ah! It's Gramps!

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:28.960
Takao...

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:34.990
Hey, Takao!

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:38.260
Don't you think it's rude to
run away after seeing my face?

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:43.200
Y-Yeah but... You're here to force me to go back to doing <i>kendo</i> training, aren't you?

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:44.480
I'm begging you!

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:47.840
The finals are up next! Can't you wait a bit longer?

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:52.050
That's what you were worried about?

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:56.330
Who do you take me for, Takao?!

00:03:56.330 --> 00:04:02.860
It's true that I don't like this game. But if you're a man that lives by the code of <i>kendo</i> like me, you can't run from a duel!

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:04.480
A d-duel?

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:07.610
It's less of a duel and more of a Bey Battle, but...

00:04:07.610 --> 00:04:10.060
Get off me, please... Get off me...

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.240
And that is why... Come in!

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:17.300
I heard you're having a duel, Takao-chan!

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:18.920
We came to cheer you on!

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:19.970
I made this myself.

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:23.290
I came here to cheer on you together with the whole neighborhood!

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:26.340
First things first, you can't fight on an empty stomach.

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:27.090
Yeah!

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.710
Eat to your heart's content!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.750
Moreso than cheering him on...

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.750
It looks like they just wanted to have a banquet.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:42.240
Still, just how much can he eat?

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:43.020
So good!

00:04:57.010 --> 00:04:58.240
It's tasty, you know.

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:09.040
It <i>is </i>good, though...

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:19.500
We are at the finals of the
Beyblade Super Battle Tournament!

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:23.200
The best Bayblader in Japan will be decided soon!

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:26.030
A fierce battle for the top is about to begin!

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:31.320
First of all, let me introduce the two passionate Beybladers who made it here!

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:35.230
In the Blue Corner, Takao Kinomiya!

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:39.890
In the Red Corner, Kai Hiwatari!

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:45.630
Takao! Fight on!

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:48.760
We're looking forward to a wonderful Bey Battle!

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.890
The final match will be a 'best-out-of-three'!

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:54.280
The first to score two points wins!

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:57.280
Contestants, it's time to get to the shooting points!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:01.750
Kai! The time to settle our score has come at last!

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:02.770
Fight me!

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:06.370
Settle our score..? Foolish.

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:09.750
Retire from the fight before you embarrass yourself.

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.110
What did you say?!

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:18.000
You're about to realize how big the difference in power between you and I is, in front of this huge crowd.

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:21.400
First... Battle!

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:25.390
Dragoon! Let's show him our true power!

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:28.450
Three, Two, One...

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:31.910
Go... Shoot!

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:34.200
Go!

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:58.960
Okay! Go with your Storm Attack!

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:02.720
Here it is!

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:14.540
The shock wave from Dragoon's extreme spinning is generating a storm!

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:30.070
H-He got blown away...

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:32.850
DJ! The verdict!

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:40.290
The first battle is won by Takao Kinomiya!

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:42.800
Alright!

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.820
Wow...

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:47.900
He didn't blow away just the
Beyblade but the Beyblader too!

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:54.540
Unbelievable! So strong!
Right now Takao is <i>really</i> strong!

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:59.210
Indeed! The power of Dragoon combined with Takao's own power who controls it...

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:02.370
The two of them bring out
the most of each other's potential!

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:06.340
Takao and Dragoon are really the strongest team!

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.370
We did it, Dragoon!

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:10.080
I wouldn't expect any less, Takao...

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:13.370
Now, how will Kai-kun react to this..?

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:17.490
Well, Kai? How do you like the strength of me and my powered-up Dragoon?

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:22.930
Huh? Are you so shocked you
can't even talk or something..?

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:28.670
I admit, you <i>did </i>surprise me a little.

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:32.640
I didn't think you had become this strong...

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:34.890
What?

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:38.030
Are you complimenting me?

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:40.800
You fool! Don't get cocky!

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:46.130
I am about to show you the true extent of my power.

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:56.200
The true extent..? Are you saying you were holding back during our fight just now?!

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:58.420
You can drop the act!

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:04.420
The real fight starts now. I will show you the true terror of a <i>real </i>Bey Battle.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:06.930
Try all you want, the result won't change!

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:09.440
End the battle with the next round, Takao!

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:14.880
Judging by the battle just now, Takao's power has overwhelmed Kai.

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:18.240
We can assume the same
thing will happen in the next one.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:20.430
No good. Takao, you moron...

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:24.050
He's getting overconfident because of his victory.

00:09:24.050 --> 00:09:29.040
He hasn't realized that his opponent's aura has completely changed from before.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:30.340
His aura..?

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.220
Second battle! Set!

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:47.300
Three, Two, One...

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:50.000
Go... Shoot!

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:01.960
Go, Dragoon!

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:07.650
Storm Attack!

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:18.810
Here it is! It's Dragoon's Storm Attack!

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:20.540
Dranzer is in trouble!

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:28.280
What's going on? The storm... It's being torn apart?!

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:35.310
Dranzer is tearing the storm apart!

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:37.820
Burn up, Dranzer!

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:49.670
Suzaku!

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:53.790
At last, Kai too is using his secret power.

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:55.950
Kai Hiwatari...

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:03.940
Go! Fire Arrow!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:27.460
Wow! Just like that, it's over! The winner of the second battle is Kai Hiwatari!

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:31.620
Did you see that? <i>This</i> is my true power.

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:35.490
There is no reason for you to keep fighting anymore.

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:38.040
This fight is over.

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:42.400
What..? Takao's body is shaking!

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:43.770
It's fear.

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:45.380
Fear?

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:50.020
After witnessing Kai's true
power, he's afraid of fighting.

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:50.980
That can't be!

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:55.090
After getting cocky you got brought back to reality...

00:11:56.290 --> 00:12:01.410
Takao, the most important thing in a fight isn't power or techniques...

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:02.740
It's your spirit!

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:06.800
If you lose the will to fight, you will <i>never</i> be able to win!

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:17.050
Amazing. You're amazing, Kai!
I had no idea you were this strong!

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:21.450
The stronger the oppponent I'm against is, the more I get fired up!

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:24.960
Do you seriously think you can win against me?

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:27.220
I don't care about winning or losing.

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:31.970
I'm going to fight! As long as
my Dragoon can fight with me!

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:34.980
Wow! Takao stood up again!

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:38.530
Still, I wonder if Takao will be able to win this.

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:44.080
It's going to be a tough battle. Takao needs to bring out more power than ever before.

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:48.310
That's the spirit, Takao! The real fight starts now!

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:52.330
Now! Whatever the outcome, this will be the final battle!

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:54.630
Whoever wins will be the champion!

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:57.730
It looks to me like Kai has a big advantage.

00:12:57.730 --> 00:13:00.880
I don't think so. Takao's not
the type to give in just like that.

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:08.520
Kai <i>is</i> strong. He's undoubtedly the strongest Beyblader I've ever fought against.

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:11.720
But I'm not fighting alone.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:17.010
The professor, Max, Rei...
All of them have made me stronger!

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:20.760
I am going to fight, with Dragoon on my side!

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:25.040
I can feel it! Tako's power is rising up!

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:27.650
Here it comes!

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:30.160
Final battle! Set!

00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:36.390
Fool! Do you intend to win against me?!

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:41.390
I am not alone! I'm fighting together with Dragoon!

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:44.440
Three, Two, One...

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:46.050
Go.. Shoot!

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:48.140
Go! Dranzer!

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:50.320
Go, Dragoon!

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:16.000
Here they are!

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:18.840
What incredible power!

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:21.720
The power of the Sacred Beasts has been released!

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:25.210
That Takao... He can do it when he tries!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:37.170
An incredibly fierce battle is taking place,

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:40.000
and the whole stadium is about to be destroyed!

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:43.440
That's the Storm Attack!

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:47.840
And here's the Fire Arrow!

00:14:52.920 --> 00:14:55.530
W-Where does this light come from..?!

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:03.800
W-what..?!

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:14.000
W-What?

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:21.460
W-What's going on? Both the storm and the flames vanished into thin air!

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:23.540
What the heck happened?!

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:32.450
What happened? Both Dragoon and Dranzer vanished from the Stadium and are nowhere to be seen!

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:33.680
Dranzer!

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:36.660
Dragoon! What's going on?!

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:43.350
There they are! The two Beyblades had flown high up in the sky!

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:44.800
Dragoon!

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:46.560
Dranzer!
Dragoon!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:50.870
Wow! They're still at it!

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:53.100
Don't give up!

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:54.600
Go!

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:08.670
Dragoon!

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:11.030
Dranzer!

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:21.160
D-Dranzer is out of the ring!

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:23.410
The match is over!

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:27.620
Beyblade Battle tournament finals:

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:31.330
The winner is Takao Kinomiya!

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:34.660
Heck yeah!

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:40.950
Takao won!

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:42.720
He did it! He's the best!

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:48.720
Their power was at the same exact level. Takao had just a bit of luck on his side.

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:51.040
I-It was an incredible fight!

00:16:51.060 --> 00:16:55.330
We couldn't expect any less from the final match of the tournament!

00:16:56.880 --> 00:16:57.440
Kai...

00:17:04.630 --> 00:17:06.000
I admit my defeat.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:06.730
Kai..?

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:12.210
It was truly an outstanding final fight.

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:15.710
President Daitenji..? Rei..?

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:22.700
You showed us a splendid battle, worthy of the name of final battle of the tournament.

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:26.820
Foolish words. What meaning is there to a fight outside of winning?

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:29.970
The only thing I want is the title of strongest.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:36.830
This tournament wasn't made for the sake of deciding the strongest Beyblader.

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:40.980
The battle to decide who <i>truly</i> is the strongest starts now.

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:42.050
What did you say?!

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:43.780
What do you mean?

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:51.100
The Beyblade Super Battle Tournament ends here with Takao Kinomiya as the champion,

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:55.120
and Kai Hiwatari follows him in second place!

00:17:58.270 --> 00:18:01.650
That's not all! The two in the top positions,

00:18:01.650 --> 00:18:03.900
an those who made it to the semi-finals,

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:05.020
Max,

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:05.650
Me..?

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:07.860
and Rei...

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:16.380
These four will participate as representatives in the Beyblade World Championship which will begin soon!

00:18:18.880 --> 00:18:20.840
W-What..?!

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:23.650
W-World Championship..?

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:23.660
Takao and Max were chosen as representatives..?
W-World Championship..?

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.980
Takao and Max were chosen as representatives..?

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:30.530
You're surprised, I bet.

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:39.040
This tournament also was also created to choose the team members that the BBA will send to the World Championship.

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:40.510
World Championship?

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:45.040
That's right. Beyblade as a discipline is spreading all over the world.

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:48.970
The world is full of powerful bladers still unknown to us.

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:54.370
I only entered this tournament after President Datenji asked.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:59.950
We wanted to know if there are still bladers strong enough in Japan to take on world-class opponents.

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:04.250
After fighting you, Takao, I was sure of it.

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:09.380
We can fight side by side, against powerful opponents from around the world.

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:11.990
What's wrong?

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:17.800
Wow! So I will be able to fight against strong people from all over the world?

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:20.410
Just thinking about it gets me excited!

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:23.210
I knew you would say that.

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:24.300
Rei!

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:25.850
Let's fight together.

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:27.070
Yeah!

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:30.850
Takao!

00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:32.250
Takao!

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:34.210
Max! Professor!

00:19:35.140 --> 00:19:36.620
Congratulations, Takao!

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:40.570
Wow! We have the chance to battle against the world!

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:42.030
This is exciting!

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:44.240
Yeah! Let's go crazy with all we've got!

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:47.280
What are you going to do, Kai-kun?

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:50.730
My only goal is to defeat all the Beyblades with Sacred Bea—

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:57.380
Oh oh, Kai-kun. Did you think that Beyblades with the Sacred Beasts only existed in Japan?

00:19:57.600 --> 00:19:58.300
What?!

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:05.390
Around the world there might be Beyblades with even more powerful Sacred Beasts, you know.

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:12.710
Of course, fighting and winning against those powerful opponents one after the other will not be an easy task...

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:17.000
I undestand. I will go too.

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.490
Alright!

00:20:18.490 --> 00:20:22.870
Kai! I see, we're going to be teammates from now on.

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:23.860
Let's do our best.

00:20:24.210 --> 00:20:25.730
Don't misunderstand.

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:29.290
I never said I would become your comrade or anything.

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:35.170
I'm only doing this to defeat the Beyblader that controls the strongest Sacred Beast,

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:42.380
This changes nothing. Sooner or later, I am going to fight and defeat all of your Beyblades.

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:46.900
Well, we're just getting started after all.

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:49.500
This is going to be interesting, don't you agree?

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:56.130
Takao will have the chance to fight against the world. I can hardly wait!

00:20:56.340 --> 00:21:03.730
That's right! These four here will take off to battle against the world as representatives of the BBA!

00:21:03.730 --> 00:21:05.920
First, the Asia regional qualifiers!

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:11.220
China will be the stage of these battles!  Everybody, I'm counting on you for support!

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:20.900
World Championship, huh...

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:27.920
Alright! This time our opponent is the whole world!

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:30.130
Let's go, Dragoon!

